{"time": 1761742670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185071457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？说到看不见，第一反应不都是隐形术么”"}
{"time": 1761742676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432702900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵..\"轻笑，\"我只有识破隐形。\""}
{"time": 1761742682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281037493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是你用光尘不也一样?\""}
{"time": 1761742706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068843766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过隐形了还能攻击，敌人恐怕是类似高等隐形术的能力吧，我只听协会的前辈说过这个法术”"}
{"time": 1761742731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524758744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“听不懂你们在说什么”"}
