{"time": 1761752996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154759243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "你研究了一下，意识到他们希望使用书中的仪式在幽暗森林开启传送门与“虚空暗幕的子嗣”联系，进一步强化他们关于禁忌魔法和奥术秘密的知识。"}
{"time": 1761753016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676292375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不错。\""}
{"time": 1761753024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175957278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "并且还有一句警告"}
{"time": 1761753031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34662009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“可怕的方式消耗这一本质，在交易中变得更加强大，只有终结这一本质才能挑战入侵者在你的世界的权力”"}
{"time": 1761753031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301278161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感觉很有意思，先不开口跟队友解释书中内容"}
